flowchart LR
    U[User Query] --> C[CLI]
    C --> G1[Guardrails<br/>length / disallowed terms]
    G1 -->|refused| O1[Refusal Response]
    G1 -->|ok| P[Planner<br/>intent + slots]
    P --> R1[KB Retriever<br/>TF-IDF over markdown]
    P --> R2[Catalog Search<br/>filter + score tracks]
    R1 --> D[Recommender<br/>LLM or fallback]
    R2 --> D
    D --> K[Checker<br/>grounding + slot satisfaction]
    K -->|fail| V[Reviser<br/>broaden filters / regenerate]
    V --> K
    K -->|pass| O2[Recommendations + Summary + Citations]

    P --> L[(Trace Logs<br/>logs/agent_trace.jsonl)]
    R1 --> L
    R2 --> L
    D --> L
    K --> L
    V --> L

    T[Eval Harness<br/>eval/run_eval.py] --> C
    H[Human Reviewer] --> T
    T --> M[Metrics Report<br/>eval/last_report.json]
